<instruction name="VSM3MSG2">
 <copyright>Copyright (C) Intel Corporation. All Rights Reserved.</copyright>
 <shortdesc>Perform Final Calculation for the Next Four SM3 Message Words</shortdesc>
 <longdesc><para unique="1048102">
   <string>The VSM3MSG2 instruction is one of the two SM3 message scheduling instructions. The instruction performs the final calculation for the next four SM3 message words.</string></para>
  </longdesc>
 <subsection title="Flags Affected">
  <para unique="1048135">
   <string>None.</string></para>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="Intel C/C++ Compiler Intrinsic Equivalent">
  <programlisting><string>VSM3MSG2 __m128i _mm_sm3msg2_epi32 (__m128i __A, __m128i __B, __m128i __C);</string><string>
</string></programlisting>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="SIMD Floating-Point Exceptions">
  <para unique="1047135">
   <string>None.</string></para>
  </subsection>
 <subsection title="Other Exceptions">
  <para unique="1046793">
   <string>See </string><link linkend="25627: 06_Table: Table 2-21. Type 4 Class Exception Conditions"><string>Table&#160;2&#8209;21, &#8220;Type 4 Class Exception Conditions.&#8221;</string></link></para>
  </subsection>
 </instruction>
